      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61734d8acc7413744089269c|full_name} Through more testing I was able to narrow this down to the VRChat/Mobile/Standard Lite shader.  \n\nSpecifically an object with 'Specular Anti-Aliasing' enabled on the Standard Lite shader.  As soon as I disable this option baking works normally.\n\nEdit: Able to 100% reproduce in a fresh project via the following steps:\n\n1. New project, put the Standard lite shader on the floor\n\n2. Configure the Mesh Renderer to enable 'Contribute Global Illumination'\n\n3. Ensure 'Specular Anti-Aliasing' is enabled on the shader\n\n4. Attempt to bake.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
